/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
*.log
charts/*/charts

__pycache__
tls
!.roo/rules/AGENTS.md

# #534/ADR-0030: the it-machine client_credentials keypair and the rendered IT-only authz-idp
# config that registers it are generated fresh at IT-stack-up time
# (.docker/it/generate_it_machine_fixtures.py) -- never committed, so a real private key never
# trips a secret scanner even as test-only material (PR #604).
.docker/it/generated/
.docker/authz/container.it.yaml

# ADR-0029: /dist is a staging area `just stage-authz-ui` (local) / the `stage-authz-ui` composite
# action (CI) populates by pulling the pinned, externally-built `authz-ui` OCI artifact -- never a
# build output of this repo, and never the artifact itself (the artifact is the GHCR image). ~100
# of these files were committed by accident in #599; this entry, plus `git rm -r --cached dist/`,
# untracks them going forward.
/dist/

.lci